    /// @dev Reverts if one of `tokenIds` is not owned by `from`.
    /// @dev Reverts if the sender is not `from` and has not been approved by `from` for each of `tokenIds`.
    /// @dev Emits a {Transfer} event for each of `tokenIds`.
